[{"id":"og_1792597351892_5_0kz8s","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351897,"sender":"them","text":"早上出门的时候你还没醒。他弯腰看了一眼，被子蹬到腰上，睡衣皱巴巴地卷着，露出一小截肚子，头发乱糟糟地铺在枕头上。嘴微微张着，呼吸很轻。他在床边站了大概十秒钟，伸手把被子拉上来，指尖碰到你腰侧皮肤的时候摩挲了一下。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3195},{"id":"og_1792597351892_6_6t0ry","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351898,"sender":"them","text":"温热的，软的。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3196},{"id":"og_1792597351892_7_fzh4t","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351899,"sender":"them","text":"他收回手，出了门。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3197},{"id":"og_1792597351892_8_7k21u","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351900,"sender":"them","text":"一整天都在想那一截腰身。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3198},{"id":"og_1792597351892_9_2xkug","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351901,"sender":"them","text":"开会的时候在想，你翻身的时候腰上那条线是什么弧度。签文件的时候在想，你的皮肤是不是因为刚睡醒所以格外烫。下属在旁边汇报什么演习方案，他\"嗯\"了一声，脸上没有任何多余的表情，手里的笔稳得像画直线。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3199},{"id":"og_1792597351892_10_n174r","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351902,"sender":"them","text":"没有人知道他在走神。也没有人看得出来。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3200},{"id":"og_1792597351892_11_fm1hg","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351903,"sender":"them","text":"他太擅长这个了。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3201},{"id":"og_1792597351892_12_7viev","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351904,"sender":"them","text":"厨房灶台上还温着一锅汤。排骨炖的，加了玉米和山药。他回来以后先去厨房忙了四十分钟，洗菜切肉调火候，动作利落得不像一个军官倒像干了十几年的家庭煮夫。围裙都没系，袖子往上一撸就开干了，溅了几滴油在手背上也没在意。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3202},{"id":"og_1792597351892_13_3o7qs","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351905,"sender":"them","text":"菜做好了，汤煲着，桌上摆了三菜一汤，筷子并排放好，你那边的碗里还垫了一张纸巾防灰。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3203},{"id":"og_1792597351892_14_52267","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351906,"sender":"them","text":"然后他洗了手，倒了杯酒，坐到沙发上等。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3204},{"id":"og_1792597351892_15_swbch","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351907,"sender":"them","text":"电视里在放什么新闻，他没听进去一个字。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3205},{"id":"og_1792597351892_16_7svlc","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351908,"sender":"them","text":"他在听门口的动静。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3206},{"id":"og_1792597351892_17_2e25m","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351909,"sender":"them","text":"说不上来从什么时候开始养成了这个习惯。可能是你上学那会儿，每天下午他要是在家就会卡着放学的时间坐在客厅，耳朵竖着等那个门锁转动的声音。钥匙插进去、锁芯咔哒一响、门把手往下压、然后是踢踏踢踏跑进来的脚步声。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3207},{"id":"og_1792597351892_18_vdhsz","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351910,"sender":"them","text":"那个声音对他来说比什么都好听。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3208},{"id":"og_1792597351892_19_nqoux","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351911,"sender":"them","text":"比枪上膛的声音好听，比任务完成的确认信号好听，比所有人喊他\"首长\"的声音加在一起都好听。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3209},{"id":"og_1792597351892_20_n4w0l","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351912,"sender":"them","text":"他自己也觉得好笑。一个在部队里杀伐果断的人，一个底下管着几百号兵的人，一个黑白两道给几分面子的人，每天最期待的事是听自己女儿开门回家的声音。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3210},{"id":"og_1792597351892_21_0tl7s","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351913,"sender":"them","text":"酒杯里的冰块彻底化了。他端起来喝了一口，凉的，威士忌的味道被水冲淡了，寡淡得像白开水。他没在意，把杯子放回去，拇指无意识地摩挲了一下食指指腹。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3211},{"id":"og_1792597351892_22_pwo0m","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351914,"sender":"them","text":"手机亮了一下。他拿起来看，不是你发的，是汤镇南那边传过来的一份文件，标了加急。他点开扫了两眼，回了一个字\"阅\"，锁屏，放下。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3212},{"id":"og_1792597351892_23_urtck","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351915,"sender":"them","text":"壁纸是你。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3213},{"id":"og_1792597351892_24_p2m7w","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351916,"sender":"them","text":"去年冬天拍的，你站在路灯底下，围巾裹到鼻子，只露出一双眼睛，被冻得红红的，在笑。他记得那天晚上接你回来，车上暖气开得很足，你一上车就把冰凉的手往他手心里塞，嘴里喊着\"爸爸，我手好冷\"。他握住了，没说话，把你的手整个包在掌心里捂着。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3214},{"id":"og_1792597351892_25_37fgn","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351917,"sender":"them","text":"他把手机翻扣在茶几上，仰头靠着沙发背，闭了一会儿眼。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3215},{"id":"og_1792597351892_26_125of","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351918,"sender":"them","text":"脑子里不知道为什么又跳出早上那个画面。你的腰，你的肚子，被子底下模模糊糊的腿的轮廓。你睡得那么沉，完全不设防，整个人软塌塌地摊在他的床上，像一块化了一半的奶糖。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3216},{"id":"og_1792597351892_27_juqfk","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351919,"sender":"them","text":"他的喉结动了一下。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3217},{"id":"og_1792597351892_28_ojf0x","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351920,"sender":"them","text":"然后他睁开眼，脸上什么都没有。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3218},{"id":"og_1792597351892_29_xfcmr","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351921,"sender":"them","text":"就在这时候，门口传来了动静。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3219},{"id":"og_1792597351892_30_1o2kx","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351922,"sender":"them","text":"钥匙插进锁芯，咔哒一声，门把手往下压。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3220},{"id":"og_1792597351892_31_35v39","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351923,"sender":"them","text":"他没动。还是那个姿势靠在沙发上，手搭着靠背，眼睛随意地看着电视屏幕，好像只是一个普通的、等女儿回家吃饭的父亲。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3221},{"id":"og_1792597351892_32_n7zse","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351924,"sender":"them","text":"门开了。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3222},{"id":"og_1792597351892_33_ojxdh","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351925,"sender":"them","text":"\"回来了？\"他的声音不大，低低的，从胸腔里稳稳地送出来，像每一个平常的傍晚一样。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3223},{"id":"og_1792597351892_34_1h29m","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351926,"sender":"them","text":"\"饭做好了，洗手吃饭。\"","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3224},{"id":"og_1792597351892_35_53zcy","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351927,"sender":"them","text":"他没有回头。但他的耳朵在等。等你的脚步声，等你喊他，等你像往常一样踢掉鞋子朝他跑过来。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3225},{"id":"og_1792597351892_36_jw81k","time":"23:42","timestamp":1792597351928,"sender":"them","text":"等那个让他想了一整天的声音。","userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3226},{"id":1792665387679,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"23:43","timestamp":1792597389257,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3227},{"id":1792665387680,"text":"你怎么在这坐着呀","sender":"me","time":"23:44","timestamp":1792597496968,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3228},{"id":1792665387682,"text":"下来喝水。","rawContent":"下来喝水。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:45","timestamp":1792597506925,"roundId":"round_1792597497905_ivzt3kov9","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3229},{"id":1792665387683,"text":"鞋呢？","rawContent":"鞋呢？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:45","timestamp":1792597513770,"roundId":"round_1792597497905_ivzt3kov9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3230},{"id":1792665387684,"text":"穿了的","sender":"me","time":"23:46","timestamp":1792597572298,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3231},{"id":1792665387685,"text":"不想喝了呀……","sender":"me","time":"23:46","timestamp":1792597575856,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3232},{"id":1792665387687,"text":"不喝就放着。鞋穿好没有？过来坐。","rawContent":"不喝就放着。鞋穿好没有？过来坐。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:46","timestamp":1792597583078,"roundId":"round_1792597576632_g1pcvlnx9","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"693608b9-148f-4666-a4fa-0c47e4f45c63","_id":3233},{"id":1792665387688,"text":"没有呀","sender":"me","time":"23:47","timestamp":1792597671046,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1774882388181_mr0vrjk8f","characterId":"1929a897-eec1-4f3e-bd94-75a280ba28dd","_id":3234},{"id":1792665387689,"text":"怎么一找你就催我睡觉","sender":"me","time":"23:48","timestam